## Context
`erg-pr-merge` died with "no close-claim" on a body line `**Ticket:** 1075`,
although the intent is unambiguous. Tolerating the short form would leave
merged bodies that roar's `check-close-claims.sh` (strict regex) cannot read.

## Exit criteria
- [x] A short `Ticket: NNNN` resolving to exactly one `tickets/(closed/)NNNN-*.erg` is rewritten on the forge to the canonical path, read back, and closed
- [x] Zero or several matches keep the refusal; body untouched
- [x] `#NNNN` and `chore(NNNN)` never close a ticket
- [x] `tests/test_erg_pr_merge.sh` covers all three; `skills/merge/SKILL.md` documents the rule
